# Code owners are auto-requested as reviewers on pull requests that touch
# these paths. This only BLOCKS a merge once branch protection on `main`
# enables "Require review from Code Owners" — until then it is advisory.
# See docs/security-remediation-plan.md §0.4.
#
# Later rules take precedence over earlier ones for the same file, so the
# security-sensitive globs are kept last.

# CI, release and install plumbing.
/.github/**                    @mjudeikis @cwilhit
/hack/install/**               @mjudeikis @cwilhit

# Hub control plane, edge agent, shared server, the provider SDK and the
# edges provider (the tunnel / proxy data plane).
/pkg/hub/**                    @mjudeikis @cwilhit
/pkg/agent/**                  @mjudeikis @cwilhit
/pkg/server/**                 @mjudeikis @cwilhit
/provider-sdk/**               @mjudeikis @cwilhit
/providers/edges/**            @mjudeikis @cwilhit

# Anything named after auth, proxies or tokens, anywhere in the tree
# (Go, TypeScript, charts, scripts alike).
**/auth*                       @mjudeikis @cwilhit
**/*proxy*                     @mjudeikis @cwilhit
**/*token*                     @mjudeikis @cwilhit
